                outer bottom corner rounded r=4. Left edge sews to the c.f. seam. Vertical
                buttonholes 2 long, 2 in from the seam edge, centred at 5 / 9.5 / 14 from the
                top - matching the buttons on the "fly button stand". Standard jeans method,
                not from Muller.-->
            <point id="235" mx="0.132292" my="0.264583" name="fv_0" showPointName="true" type="single" x="36" y="52"/>
